@startuml ChartLibraryPRPipelineFlow
title Chart Library PR Pipeline Flow

start

:PR opened or updated;
:Run 1 starts (Validate job);
:Validate consumer compatibility (PR only);
:Bump template versions (PR only);

if (Template changes detected?) then (Yes)
	:Commit [auto-bump] to PR source branch;
	:Run 2 starts from new head commit;
	:Detect PR context\n(read source branch head message);

	if (Head message contains [auto-bump]?) then (Yes)
		:Skip consumer compatibility + bump jobs;
		:PR run completes with audit trail;
		note right
			pr.autoCancel = false keeps Run 1 visible.
			Run 2 appears as separate run.
		end note
	else (No)
		:Validate consumer compatibility (PR only);
		:Bump template versions (PR only);
	endif
else (No)
	:No bump commit created (Run 1 completes);
endif

stop

@enduml
